# DigitalGuardian area 53: fn_14_A6A8's "OPEN" (0x4F50454E) when the beacon is already up
# (0x1268 == 1: the cmpwi at 0xAA4C skips the case). The beacon rises only in the Crippled state
# (fn_14_7CB4's Update runs fn_14_2CC4), reaching 1.0 after 60 updates; the second OPEN comes later.
@f30 layer 3
@f60 layer 11
@f160 send e00350060 Activate; send e0035000f Activate
@f200 send e00350060 0x4F50454E
@f220 fsm e00350060 CrippledReaction
@f400 obj e00350060
@f420 send e00350060 0x4F50454E
@f440 covdump
